### BlogHub Publishing REST API Spec
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. User Signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sarah Chen",
  "email": "sarah@bloghub.io",
  "password": "SecretPassword456"
}

### 2. User Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah@bloghub.io",
  "password": "SecretPassword456"
}

### 3. Get Articles List
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles

### 4. Create Article (Auth required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "title": "Scaling Next.js Applications with Redis",
  "content": "Next.js server-side caching helps reduce costs...",
  "tags": ["NextJS", "Redis", "Performance"]
}

### 5. Update Article (Author-only operation)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/articles/123
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "title": "Scaling Next.js Applications with Redis (Updated)"
}

### 6. Delete Article (Author-only operation)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/articles/123
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>
